### What filters are live on this table right now?
# The one you will actually reuse. statecode eq 0 keeps it to ACTIVE associations, and
# the $expand pulls each filter's real FetchXML into the same response, so one call
# gives you the complete picture. First stop when a user reports seeing the wrong rows.
GET {{orgUrl}}/api/data/v9.2/entityrecordfilters?$select=name,objecttypecode,statecode&$filter=objecttypecode eq '{{prefix}}_store' and statecode eq 0&$expand=RecordFilterId($select=displayname,uniquename,fetchxml) HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
OData-MaxVersion: 4.0
OData-Version: 4.0
